  "prefLabel": "Lot 7002.29 Senior citizens organization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.29 “Senior citizens organization” means a nonprofit association or club whose members are 55 years of age or older, and which exists for the mutual support and benefit of New Hampshire’s senior citizens.\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34 (formerly Lot 7002.26)",
